      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The standout of the season is undoubtedly the LV Lodge bag, which brings a \"ski chalet\" to life. Crafted from fine calfskin with Monogram canvas details, it features a snow-covered roof, tiny open windows, a Monogram chimney, and cut-out Monogram flower ornaments. The roof opens to reveal the interior—a playful, cozy design that also makes a charming holiday display and a collectible piece of craftsmanship.",
